00:00:22.724 --> 00:00:23.645
My ranch in Montana.

00:00:23.645 --> 00:00:24.478
- [Jennifer] Okay.

00:00:24.478 --> 00:00:25.311
- Yes, it's better for them.

00:00:25.311 --> 00:00:26.407
- They're happier.

00:00:26.407 --> 00:00:27.240
- [Kelly] Yeah, yeah.

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:28.407
- And yes,
- [Kelly] Space.

