00:00:47.578 --> 00:00:48.986
There's just a tiny bit of,

00:00:48.986 --> 00:00:49.886
- Yeah, just a.

00:00:49.886 --> 00:00:51.046
- I love that though,

00:00:51.046 --> 00:00:51.898
- That's fun.
- [Jennifer] Yeah.

00:00:51.898 --> 00:00:52.731
- Living on a farm, that's better.

00:00:52.731 --> 00:00:53.564
- [Jennifer] Yes.

00:00:53.564 --> 00:00:55.546
